<caml:Content xmlns:caml="http://lc.ca.gov/legalservices/schemas/caml.1#"><p>“Passenger” is a person on whose behalf money or other consideration has been given or is to be given to another, including another member of the same partnership, corporation, joint venture, association, organization, group, or other entity, for air or sea transportation, other travel services, or both, for that person.</p></caml:Content>